# Copy-and-edit ServiceMonitor for Prometheus Operator (SOL-152424). Named
# .example so the directory-wide `kubectl apply` skips it: the CRD
# (monitoring.coreos.com/v1) is not on every cluster, and one missing kind
# fails the whole apply. Without the Operator, use the annotation fallback in
# docs/observability.md § "Scraping and securing the metrics endpoint".
#
# Apply it in the same namespace as service.yaml — a ServiceMonitor selects
# Services in its own namespace unless spec.namespaceSelector says otherwise.
#
# Four things must hold before a target appears; only the first fails loudly:
#   1. OBS_METRICS_SCRAPE_ENABLED=true on the Deployment (deployment.yaml carries the
#      commented env entry), or every scrape is `connection refused`.
#   2. The `metrics` port on service.yaml (shipped): `endpoints[].port` below
#      names a Service port, not a container port.
#   3. Prometheus selects this object. kube-prometheus-stack by default selects
#      only ServiceMonitors labelled `release: <its Helm release>` — EDIT the
#      label below, or set serviceMonitorSelectorNilUsesHelmValues to false.
#      If Prometheus runs in another namespace, its
#      serviceMonitorNamespaceSelector must be `{}` or match this one; unset
#      means its own namespace only. Neither mismatch is an error anywhere;
#      the only symptom is no target.
#   4. Ingress to :9091 from Prometheus's namespace — networkpolicy.yaml
#      allows `monitoring`; edit it if yours differs.
#
# Exemplars need two Prometheus-side settings this object cannot supply:
# exemplar storage (`spec.enableFeatures: [exemplar-storage]` on the Prometheus
# CR) and a scrape that negotiates OpenMetrics. Without them the scrape
# succeeds and the trace links are silently absent — docs/observability.md
# § "Trace Exemplars".
apiVersion: monitoring.coreos.com/v1
kind: ServiceMonitor
metadata:
  name: solace-broker-mcp
  labels:
    app.kubernetes.io/name: solace-broker-mcp
    # EDIT: kube-prometheus-stack's default selector matches on this label.
    release: kube-prometheus-stack
spec:
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app.kubernetes.io/name: solace-broker-mcp
  endpoints:
    - port: metrics
      path: /metrics
      interval: 15s
      scrapeTimeout: 10s
